{
  "version": "10.24.16.96987",
  "_why": "batch-2 journey guards that FAILed or stayed INVALID on healthy OLD apps: a data view picked before the page title (B2-2: in the DOM with zero height), a guard on a tab page not shown first (G-3) or hidden on desktop, an API-only role whose home is the login page (B2-3), a layout user menu whose top item has no caption (T2R3-4, icon-only dropdown), page texts that are not on screen: a placeholder and the page Title without a title widget or popup layout (N1R2-3)",
